  "details": "Hello VRChat, I come through this feedback to bring an observation and suggestions:\n\n- Why don't you unify the Poor and VeryPoor categories? Since they are very close in requirements, it doesn't make any difference.\n\n- Nowadays, we players already have enough protection systems to consider the RANK system something almost futile. So I wanted to propose the removal of this system.\n\nThe reason I think this:\n\n1. We can limit avatars by safety and we can also limit them by UNCOMPRESSED SIZE and Download.\n\n2. The Ranking system, in my opinion, is somewhat flawed, once you have an avatar that goes 1 polygon beyond the recommended one, it goes to an extremely inconsistent rank.\n\n3. I think that vrchat had to continue investing in limitations based on components in the avatar and not through RANK, which unfortunately, in my opinion, is useless.",
